        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shared scopes also sync with the teammates you turn on here when you are not nearby, for example over Tailscale. Turn it on for each other on both Macs. Only shared-scope sync uses it: no pings, no chat. This Mac listens on TCP port %@, never advertises it, and answers only the teammates turned on here after they prove their key; five failed attempts close it for 10 minutes. Use a private network; do not open the port to the internet."
